### Health check
GET http://localhost:4000/api/health

### Patient login (mobile)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "patient1@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "platform": "mobile"
}

### Admin login (web)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "platform": "web"
}

### Patient register start (OTP will print to backend console)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newpatient@test.com",
  "name": "New Patient",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Patient register verify (paste OTP from backend console)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newpatient@test.com",
  "code": "059801",
  "platform": "mobile"
}

### Test admin protected route (paste accessToken from admin login)
